    "created_at": "2017-08-10T20:46:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-08-10T20:46:14Z",
    "body": "It's not clear to me how the bits of spec are particularly relevant here -- but isn't one of the key questions what @bzbarsky raises in [bug 752790 comment 7](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=752790#c7):\r\n> Chrome and Safari will allow painting into the _vertical_ padding but not the _horizontal_ padding of the input, which isn't exactly expressible with CSS normally.  :(",
